WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.960 --> 01:31.150
[My Journey to You]

01:31.180 --> 01:34.100
[Episode 21]

01:54.350 --> 01:56.950
You drew this map of the Gong Residence, right?

02:00.300 --> 02:02.100
There's your handwriting on it.

02:02.730 --> 02:03.990
It's no use denying it.

02:10.000 --> 02:12.260
I did draw this map of the Gong Residence.

02:13.200 --> 02:15.660
But it was only because when I first got here,

02:16.829 --> 02:18.560
I couldn't tell the direction.

02:18.570 --> 02:20.570
I couldn't even tell east from west.

02:21.490 --> 02:23.340
The layout of the Gong Residence is complicated.

02:23.340 --> 02:24.800
So I randomly noted it down

02:25.170 --> 02:26.270
for easy access.

02:29.420 --> 02:30.950
You noted it down randomly?

02:34.840 --> 02:35.890
How do you explain

02:37.290 --> 02:38.690
the words behind it then?

02:44.079 --> 02:46.340
There are 47 posts in the Gong Residence.

02:47.340 --> 02:49.070
They are on alert day and night.

02:49.380 --> 02:50.440
From 7 a.m. to 9 a.m.

02:50.450 --> 02:51.510
From 3 p.m. to 5 p.m.

02:51.620 --> 02:52.750
From 11 p.m. to 1 a.m.

02:53.050 --> 02:54.570
The guards take turns keeping watch.

02:54.570 --> 02:56.310
There are two secret tunnels in the Gong Residence.

02:56.310 --> 02:57.310
One secret tunnel

02:57.320 --> 02:58.579
leads to the back hill,

02:59.040 --> 02:59.990
and the other

03:00.620 --> 03:02.190
leads to Jiuchen Valley.

03:06.500 --> 03:08.070
Wufeng can send their elite

03:08.980 --> 03:10.180
to sneak in from here.

03:12.530 --> 03:14.130
It's indeed for easy access.

03:15.930 --> 03:18.190
However, it's for Wufeng's easy access.

03:20.150 --> 03:20.980
At this point,

03:21.810 --> 03:23.540
are you still trying to deny it?

03:30.430 --> 03:31.290
Wufeng's spies

03:31.480 --> 03:32.340
must be killed.

03:33.290 --> 03:35.350
Execute her immediately right here.

03:49.840 --> 03:51.500
Don't help me, Sword Wielder.

03:52.220 --> 03:53.220
I lied to you.

03:55.260 --> 03:56.710
I'm indeed Wufeng's spy.

04:03.630 --> 04:04.170
Yun.

04:05.660 --> 04:06.100
You...

04:06.610 --> 04:07.640
Why did you leave?

04:10.430 --> 04:12.260
She was going to send messages out.

04:12.260 --> 04:13.720
Of course she had to leave.

05:27.410 --> 05:28.110
Yun.

05:30.650 --> 05:31.980
Are you really leaving?

05:44.830 --> 05:46.130
You once asked me

05:50.100 --> 05:52.140
what is something you can give me.

05:56.510 --> 05:58.240
Actually, from the beginning,

06:01.740 --> 06:02.940
what I wanted the most

06:09.310 --> 06:10.400
is freedom.

06:18.110 --> 06:19.440
No matter if it's Wufeng

06:23.190 --> 06:24.450
or the Gong Residence,

06:29.790 --> 06:30.800
to me,

06:36.640 --> 06:38.840
they are both surrounded by high walls,

06:39.940 --> 06:41.270
and places of shackles.

06:48.640 --> 06:49.700
Young Master Ziyu.

06:56.070 --> 06:58.640
I've failed to live up to your love for me.

07:09.790 --> 07:10.950
From now on,

07:15.170 --> 07:17.500
think of me as gone.

07:35.220 --> 07:36.250
Take care.

08:52.450 --> 08:53.810
But you are free now.

08:55.260 --> 08:56.710
You can leave Wufeng,

08:57.640 --> 08:59.030
find a quiet place,

09:00.580 --> 09:01.970
find a reliable person,

09:03.770 --> 09:05.970
and spend the rest of your life with him.

09:07.580 --> 09:09.190
I won't look for

09:12.680 --> 09:14.340
someone to spend my life with.

09:16.820 --> 09:18.150
I've already found him.

09:36.420 --> 09:38.020
Send the guards immediately

09:38.360 --> 09:40.020
and lock down Jiuchen Valley.

09:40.460 --> 09:42.520
No one is allowed to leave the valley.

09:42.620 --> 09:43.880
Hunt Yun Weishan down.

09:43.900 --> 09:44.630
Go after her!

09:45.440 --> 09:46.680
Who dares?

09:49.450 --> 09:51.310
You just let a Wufeng assassin go.

09:51.820 --> 09:53.750
And you're standing in our way now?

09:53.900 --> 09:55.230
Who do you think you are?

09:56.990 --> 10:00.050
I'm ordering you as the Sword Wielder of the Gong family

10:00.420 --> 10:01.080
to back off.

10:01.820 --> 10:02.750
What did you say?

10:03.780 --> 10:05.780
The Sword Wielder of the Gong family

10:06.950 --> 10:08.280
won't repeat his words.

10:15.780 --> 10:17.620
The saber Elder Hua was holding

10:19.160 --> 10:20.420
is one of the six sabers

10:21.090 --> 10:23.350
from the Saber Tomb of the Hua Residence.

10:24.280 --> 10:25.350
I've hacked it off.

10:29.640 --> 10:30.920
Therefore,

10:32.100 --> 10:35.030
I've officially passed the trial of the third realm.

10:36.990 --> 10:38.450
I've legitimately become

10:39.290 --> 10:41.700
the Sword Wielder of the Gong family.

10:45.970 --> 10:46.970
We'll definitely

10:48.340 --> 10:50.140
obey your order, Sword Wielder.

10:55.650 --> 10:56.430
No one

10:57.860 --> 11:00.060
shall pursue Yun Weishan in the future.

11:05.250 --> 11:07.250
The Sword Wielder won't repeat his words.

11:07.250 --> 11:08.050
Yes.

12:17.820 --> 12:18.620
Yun.

12:20.280 --> 12:21.330
I finally did it.

12:28.430 --> 12:29.820
You're finally free.

12:47.240 --> 12:48.560
Flowers wither away,

12:49.690 --> 12:51.220
and their fragrance fades.

12:53.290 --> 12:54.490
Throughout the ages,

12:57.070 --> 12:59.330
many people have written poems and songs

12:59.570 --> 13:00.850
for fallen flowers

13:02.090 --> 13:03.620
as expressions of sadness.

13:04.700 --> 13:06.430
But what they don't know is that

13:07.640 --> 13:09.510
perhaps being free to bloom

13:12.870 --> 13:13.790
and wither

13:16.060 --> 13:17.240
is the flowers' fate

13:17.720 --> 13:18.620
and wish.

13:22.930 --> 13:23.790
Sword Wielder.

13:24.840 --> 13:25.770
Don't be too sad.

13:28.100 --> 13:29.170
I'm not sad.

13:34.020 --> 13:35.790
I'm happy

13:39.230 --> 13:41.090
that she finally gained freedom.

14:05.600 --> 14:07.130
Hurry up and move the stuff.

14:07.700 --> 14:08.460
These goods are to be delivered

14:08.460 --> 14:09.600
to Wanhua Pavilion.

14:09.850 --> 14:11.420
They are all cosmetics.

14:11.840 --> 14:13.040
Be careful with them.

14:13.210 --> 14:14.830
These are precious herbs.

14:14.930 --> 14:16.050
Plus those over there,

14:16.050 --> 14:17.580
all the goods will be ready.

14:23.330 --> 14:24.830
Their footsteps are steady.

14:24.830 --> 14:26.890
The bottoms of their trousers are clean

14:26.890 --> 14:29.350
without any mud stains from goods delivery.

14:59.740 --> 15:00.820
Chi, Mei, Wang, and Liang.

15:00.820 --> 15:02.580
The higher the level, the stronger they are.

15:02.580 --> 15:04.380
Those who operate daily actions

15:04.430 --> 15:06.030
are of the levels Chi and Mei.

15:06.090 --> 15:07.140
While the level of Wang

15:07.140 --> 15:08.610
sounds like Wang, the character with the meaning of king.

15:08.610 --> 15:10.070
And there are four of them.

15:10.820 --> 15:11.470
So,

15:11.490 --> 15:12.880
they are called Four Kings

15:12.880 --> 15:14.510
within Wufeng.

15:15.310 --> 15:16.870
The four of them don't interfere in each other's business,

15:16.870 --> 15:18.590
and they each dominate one direction

15:18.590 --> 15:19.850
with independent jurisdiction.

15:19.850 --> 15:20.840
What about Liang?

15:20.840 --> 15:22.570
Of course there are two of them.

15:23.550 --> 15:24.500
But no one knows

15:24.500 --> 15:26.100
their names and identities.

15:27.160 --> 15:27.840
In fact,

15:29.260 --> 15:31.520
no one even knows if Liang really exists.

15:32.370 --> 15:33.900
So even you haven't seen it?

15:37.920 --> 15:38.780
I've only seen

15:39.120 --> 15:40.180
three of the Wangs.

16:17.020 --> 16:18.550
[True Heart True Medicine]

16:51.940 --> 16:52.670
Lead the way.

16:53.830 --> 16:55.360
What are you talking about?

16:55.450 --> 16:56.380
I don't know you.

16:57.270 --> 16:58.270
Stop pretending.

16:58.910 --> 17:00.440
Take us to Wanhua Pavilion.

17:16.900 --> 17:17.900
Young Master Hua.

17:18.599 --> 17:20.599
Who wants to see me, you or Elder Hua?

17:21.119 --> 17:22.579
I've heard about Miss Yun.

17:25.619 --> 17:26.579
I also heard that

17:26.690 --> 17:29.620
you hacked off the old man's saber in just a few moves.

17:33.310 --> 17:34.480
It seems that

17:35.240 --> 17:36.920
my Heart Frost Saber is quite powerful.

17:36.920 --> 17:38.050
The strongest saber

17:38.270 --> 17:39.970
is never about the edge of killing,

17:39.970 --> 17:41.350
but the blade of protection.

17:41.350 --> 17:42.400
When you swung that saber,

17:42.400 --> 17:43.460
the person you were trying to protect

17:43.460 --> 17:45.120
must be very important to you.

17:49.020 --> 17:50.200
Not just very.

17:52.300 --> 17:53.760
She's the most important.

17:55.280 --> 17:56.230
No matter what,

17:57.090 --> 17:58.330
I must protect her.

18:06.170 --> 18:07.770
When I was forging the saber,

18:07.970 --> 18:09.530
I already figured it out that

18:09.530 --> 18:11.060
the trial of the third realm

18:11.190 --> 18:13.650
couldn't be about cold-blooded sacrifice.

18:13.880 --> 18:16.080
The words carved on the stone were fake.

18:16.590 --> 18:17.850
What you wanted me to do

18:17.970 --> 18:19.500
is to give up the sacrifice.

18:19.610 --> 18:20.120
Right?

18:22.110 --> 18:23.310
You guessed it right.

18:23.790 --> 18:25.450
The primary responsibility of the Sword Wielder of the Gong family

18:25.450 --> 18:27.710
is to protect everyone in the Gong family

18:27.850 --> 18:29.910
and all the people in Jiuchen Valley.

18:30.050 --> 18:31.090
If a person is willing to sacrifice others

18:31.090 --> 18:32.260
just to win,

18:32.870 --> 18:34.300
someone that selfish and cold-blooded

18:34.300 --> 18:37.160
doesn't deserve to be the leader of the Gong family.

18:38.230 --> 18:38.880
But

18:39.680 --> 18:41.680
those who made it through the trial,

18:41.880 --> 18:44.300
including my older brother and Gong Shangjue,

18:44.300 --> 18:46.110
all left Hua Residence alone.

18:48.270 --> 18:50.130
If they did give up the sacrifice,

18:50.270 --> 18:52.300
where did their guards go?

18:53.140 --> 18:54.800
They were left in the back hill

18:54.810 --> 18:56.250
to be taught higher-level martial arts skills.

18:56.250 --> 18:59.380
They got special training to become Red Jade Guardians.

19:01.210 --> 19:02.180
I see.

19:10.250 --> 19:13.690
[Three Forms of Mirror Flower]

19:15.230 --> 19:16.890
Three Forms of Mirror Flower.

19:19.320 --> 19:20.380
Learn it yourself.

19:22.160 --> 19:23.090
Learn it myself?

19:24.450 --> 19:25.780
Shouldn't you teach me?

19:26.070 --> 19:26.930
I don't know it.

19:27.770 --> 19:29.300
Are you trying to slack off?

19:29.950 --> 19:31.400
Xue Chongzi and Young Master Yue

19:31.400 --> 19:32.930
both taught me themselves.

19:32.940 --> 19:34.110
I said I don't know it.

19:34.110 --> 19:35.710
What I meant is I don't know how to teach you because I haven't learned it myself.

19:35.710 --> 19:37.100
It's not that I don't want to teach you.

19:37.100 --> 19:38.150
My hands are tied.

19:40.770 --> 19:41.510
Really?

19:44.320 --> 19:46.720
Your eyes are full of contempt and sarcasm.

19:47.160 --> 19:48.250
I'm so sad.

19:49.260 --> 19:50.820
You've been in the back hill for so many years,

19:50.820 --> 19:54.410
and you didn't even manage to learn the Three Forms of Mirror Flower.

19:54.410 --> 19:55.140
You know that

19:55.360 --> 19:57.940
the saber techniques of Snow, Moon, and Flower

19:57.940 --> 19:59.640
become harder level by level, right?

19:59.640 --> 20:00.270
I know.

20:00.800 --> 20:02.210
So the Three Forms of Mirror Flower

20:02.210 --> 20:04.680
are the most difficult three forms among all the saber techniques.

20:04.680 --> 20:05.690
If I could master

20:05.710 --> 20:07.140
such hard saber techniques,

20:07.140 --> 20:08.170
I wouldn't be scolded

20:08.170 --> 20:09.500
by that old man all day.

20:13.070 --> 20:15.070
So, did my brother and Gong Shangjue

20:15.170 --> 20:17.900
learn the Three Forms of Mirror Flower when they left?

20:17.900 --> 20:19.230
No, neither of them did.

20:19.600 --> 20:22.610
Gong Huanyu and Gong Shangjue only learned the first form.

20:22.610 --> 20:24.560
The former Sword Wielder learned the essence of the second form,

20:24.560 --> 20:25.760
but he stopped there.

20:38.830 --> 20:39.830
Stop pretending.

20:40.340 --> 20:41.740
As if you can understand.

20:42.670 --> 20:44.730
Go back and take your time to learn it.

20:47.360 --> 20:47.960
Okay.

20:49.710 --> 20:50.710
It's not over yet.

20:50.820 --> 20:51.410
Keep the scripture well

20:51.410 --> 20:52.340
and come with me.

21:13.410 --> 21:14.610
Since you have passed

21:14.730 --> 21:16.100
the Trial of the Three Realms,

21:16.100 --> 21:17.430
it's time to let you know

21:17.900 --> 21:20.030
the biggest secret of the Gong family.

21:22.550 --> 21:23.350
A century ago,

21:23.890 --> 21:25.260
the first Sword Wielder of the Gong family

21:25.260 --> 21:28.190
came here with the three families, Xue, Yue, and Hua.

21:28.260 --> 21:29.590
He made a blood oath that

21:30.050 --> 21:31.240
his descendants would

21:31.240 --> 21:33.930
guard the back hill generation after generation.

21:33.930 --> 21:35.060
However, actually,

21:35.170 --> 21:37.300
there are very despicable infidels living

21:37.300 --> 21:40.150
somewhere deep in the back hill of the Gong residence.

21:40.150 --> 21:41.410
Guarding the back hill

21:41.770 --> 21:43.900
is to protect the people and the world.

21:45.030 --> 21:48.120
After the three residences of Xue, Yue, and Hua were built,

21:48.120 --> 21:49.040
the first Sword Wielder

21:49.040 --> 21:50.510
built another four residences,

21:50.510 --> 21:51.390
namely Shang, Jue,

21:51.390 --> 21:52.050
Zhi, and Yu,

21:52.320 --> 21:53.320
in the front hill.

21:54.230 --> 21:55.110
People in the martial world

21:55.110 --> 21:57.610
only know how powerful the front hill of the Gong family is.

21:57.610 --> 21:58.890
But they don't know that the core of it

21:58.890 --> 22:01.140
is the support of the Xue, Yue, and Hua families.

22:01.140 --> 22:04.310
If the front hill is the flesh and blood of the Gong family,

22:04.310 --> 22:05.310
then the back hill

22:05.510 --> 22:07.310
is where the heart arteries are.

22:10.220 --> 22:12.110
The three families, Xue, Yue, and Hua

22:12.110 --> 22:14.920
made use of the meteorite falling from the sky in the valley

22:14.920 --> 22:17.890
and developed the extraordinarily powerful Infinite Heat.

22:17.890 --> 22:19.340
They did that in case

22:19.590 --> 22:21.790
one day the infidels get out of control,

22:22.170 --> 22:23.690
they'll perish with them.

22:26.230 --> 22:28.520
But the Infinite Heat is too powerful.

22:29.250 --> 22:30.250
Once it falls into

22:30.280 --> 22:31.940
some vicious people's hands,

22:32.510 --> 22:34.590
the consequences would be unimaginable.

22:34.590 --> 22:35.160
So

22:35.600 --> 22:37.280
the families agreed

22:37.870 --> 22:40.330
to terminate the research on Infinite Heat,

22:40.350 --> 22:42.380
and sealed the existence of Infinite Heat

22:42.380 --> 22:43.620
as well.

22:44.510 --> 22:46.630
If it's not for the survival of the Gong family,

22:46.630 --> 22:48.270
it should never be activated.

22:48.270 --> 22:51.130
So this is the Infinite Heat you were talking about.

22:52.200 --> 22:54.340
No wonder Infinite Heat has never been used to counter Wufeng

22:54.340 --> 22:56.040
despite how powerful it is.

22:56.500 --> 22:57.340
Exactly.

22:58.160 --> 23:00.070
The power of Infinite Heat

23:00.520 --> 23:03.330
should be used to deal with the infidels in the back hill,

23:03.330 --> 23:05.080
not the people in the mortal world.

23:05.080 --> 23:06.480
So why are there infidels

23:06.840 --> 23:08.120
in the back hill?

23:08.710 --> 23:09.910
Who exactly are they?

23:12.430 --> 23:13.460
No one knows.

23:14.210 --> 23:14.820
Anyway,

23:15.160 --> 23:17.220
the rule passed down by the ancestors

23:17.720 --> 23:19.260
is to guard the back hill.

23:20.080 --> 23:23.020
This is also a secret precautiously protected by the back hill.

23:23.020 --> 23:25.480
You've become the Sword Wielder of the Gong family.

23:25.480 --> 23:26.150
Remember.

23:26.300 --> 23:29.430
You can't make judgments based on your own preferences.

23:29.740 --> 23:31.200
Activating Infinite Heat

23:31.380 --> 23:33.880
is a significant matter concerning all the people's safety.

23:33.880 --> 23:34.720
You must

23:34.970 --> 23:36.000
abide by

23:36.210 --> 23:37.670
the will of the ancestors.

23:38.270 --> 23:39.090
I understand.

23:41.170 --> 23:42.620
Why didn't Wuji kill you?

23:43.250 --> 23:44.760
Why did she go through so much trouble

23:44.760 --> 23:45.690
to imprison you?

23:48.520 --> 23:49.450
What she wants

23:49.830 --> 23:52.160
is that thing in Hua Residence, of course.

23:57.010 --> 23:58.610
Could the reason why Lady...

24:03.320 --> 24:04.720
Could the reason why Wuji

24:05.180 --> 24:06.610
imprisoned my brother

24:06.910 --> 24:07.980
be to press him

24:08.340 --> 24:09.640
for the Infinite Heat?

24:10.440 --> 24:11.240
That's right.

24:15.900 --> 24:16.870
How did Lady Wuji

24:17.370 --> 24:19.370
get to know the Infinite Heat, then?

24:19.720 --> 24:21.580
I'm afraid she was full of tricks,

24:21.720 --> 24:23.110
so she managed to get this secret

24:23.110 --> 24:24.910
out of the former Sword Wielder.

24:30.060 --> 24:31.300
Do you remember

24:31.800 --> 24:34.800
the hairpin that got the former Sword Wielder killed?

24:35.150 --> 24:36.150
What Huanyu found

24:36.360 --> 24:37.920
in that hairpin

24:38.190 --> 24:41.110
was information about the Infinite Heat.

24:41.570 --> 24:44.910
That's why he hurriedly brought Zheng Nanyi and the hairpin

24:45.020 --> 24:46.550
to the former Sword Wielder

24:47.310 --> 24:48.240
without knowing

24:48.360 --> 24:49.560
that all of this

24:49.850 --> 24:52.380
was a plot to murder the former Sword Wielder.

24:52.810 --> 24:54.210
Now that I think about it,

24:54.810 --> 24:55.880
it must be Wuji

24:56.160 --> 24:57.820
who told Zheng Nanyi about it.

24:58.890 --> 24:59.830
I see.

25:02.330 --> 25:04.310
So did Gong Shangjue leave that night

25:04.310 --> 25:05.770
also to investigate this?

25:06.340 --> 25:07.000
Shangjue.

25:07.670 --> 25:08.490
Please

25:08.740 --> 25:10.000
go to the Zheng family.

25:11.200 --> 25:11.660
Yes.

25:14.460 --> 25:17.140
All the misunderstandings and conflicts between you and Shangjue

25:17.140 --> 25:18.200
started from this.

25:18.800 --> 25:20.460
Now that you've got to know everything,

25:20.460 --> 25:22.390
don't get into any more conflicts.

25:22.630 --> 25:24.250
Although what Shangjue has done

25:24.250 --> 25:25.420
is harsh,

25:25.650 --> 25:27.650
what he did is all for the good of the Gong family.

25:27.650 --> 25:29.780
His suspicions of Wuji and Yun Weishan

25:29.880 --> 25:31.340
have also been confirmed.

25:32.340 --> 25:33.740
You are of the same blood.

25:34.180 --> 25:35.800
You are biological brothers.

25:35.800 --> 25:36.600
In the future,

25:36.730 --> 25:38.300
you should work together.

25:39.330 --> 25:40.230
One more thing.

25:41.070 --> 25:42.630
Since Yun Weishan has left,

25:43.320 --> 25:45.000
at your accession ceremony,

25:45.510 --> 25:47.170
you need to select a new bride.

25:47.780 --> 25:48.780
The Sword Wielder

25:49.210 --> 25:51.140
can't be unmarried and childless.

25:52.190 --> 25:52.900
Elder Xue.

25:53.260 --> 25:53.720
This...

25:53.810 --> 25:55.510
Let's make it five days from now.

25:55.510 --> 25:56.570
Five days from now,

25:56.730 --> 25:57.970
the five stars will come together,

25:57.970 --> 25:59.230
and the sun and the moon will collide.

25:59.230 --> 26:00.630
It's an auspicious omen.

26:11.900 --> 26:12.550
Elders.

26:12.550 --> 26:13.220
Sword Wielder.

26:13.220 --> 26:15.030
There was an explosion

26:15.400 --> 26:18.200
in Eldest Young Miss Gong Zishang's research lab.

26:25.570 --> 26:28.870
[Shang]

26:48.410 --> 26:50.140
You should wrap your wound too.

26:57.450 --> 26:59.040
When I held her just now,

27:01.860 --> 27:03.540
I almost couldn't feel her.

27:09.880 --> 27:10.830
They say

27:12.890 --> 27:14.150
simple-minded people

27:15.050 --> 27:16.310
are blessed and lucky.

27:19.670 --> 27:20.600
I'm sure Zishang

27:21.270 --> 27:22.360
will be fine.

27:39.210 --> 27:40.030
How is she?

27:42.580 --> 27:44.110
Eldest Young Miss is smart.

27:44.260 --> 27:47.120
She wetted her body with water during the explosion

27:47.130 --> 27:48.930
and covered her head with cloth.

27:49.280 --> 27:51.210
So her skin wasn't severely burnt.

27:52.950 --> 27:54.360
But continuous explosions

27:54.360 --> 27:55.640
caused strong impact.

27:56.590 --> 27:57.320
Her head,

27:57.580 --> 27:58.440
heart and lungs

27:58.790 --> 28:01.170
suffered concussions to different degrees,

28:01.170 --> 28:02.300
which led to coma.

28:05.080 --> 28:07.960
We have applied a skin-restoring dressing on her wounds,

28:07.960 --> 28:10.640
and silver needles to protect her heart and lungs.

28:10.640 --> 28:11.380
But

28:14.950 --> 28:15.960
it's up to her fate

28:16.970 --> 28:18.300
if she's going to wake up

28:18.650 --> 28:19.700
and when.

28:24.660 --> 28:26.070
Is there no other way?

28:29.370 --> 28:32.790
I'll give her acupuncture every day to recuperate her meridians.

28:32.790 --> 28:33.400
As for you,

28:34.300 --> 28:35.650
you can talk to her more.

28:42.620 --> 28:43.680
Eldest Young Miss.

28:46.970 --> 28:48.570
Can you hear me?

29:03.880 --> 29:04.410
Let's go.

29:20.730 --> 29:22.260
I've been hiding something

29:25.710 --> 29:26.600
in my heart

29:30.230 --> 29:31.830
that I didn't tell you.

29:33.970 --> 29:35.060
You kept asking me

29:36.340 --> 29:37.350
every day.

29:41.870 --> 29:43.470
It's not that I don't want to.

29:46.470 --> 29:47.800
It's because I dare not.

29:52.540 --> 29:54.940
Since the day I became Green Jade Guardian,

29:56.110 --> 29:58.680
I've only existed to protect Gong Ziyu.

30:02.250 --> 30:03.070
Life and death

30:04.480 --> 30:05.800
is not even up to me.

30:12.550 --> 30:15.280
I'm not qualified to accept your feelings for me.

30:22.990 --> 30:24.900
But now I regret it.

30:27.150 --> 30:27.900
I regret it.

30:29.690 --> 30:32.210
How nice would it be

30:35.280 --> 30:37.080
to have let you know my feelings?

30:49.190 --> 30:51.250
The fire on the ruins has been put out.

30:51.330 --> 30:52.530
It's a complete mess.

30:53.450 --> 30:57.380
Those from the Council of Elders are still investigating in the ruins.

30:58.370 --> 30:59.970
Gong Shangjue was there too.

31:03.830 --> 31:05.550
The fire and explosion took place out of the blue.

31:05.550 --> 31:06.950
It's indeed suspicious.

31:07.300 --> 31:08.220
Have you found

31:08.220 --> 31:09.280
anything unusual?

31:10.110 --> 31:11.370
I asked a few servants.

31:11.860 --> 31:12.610
They all said

31:13.410 --> 31:14.610
they saw Gong Yuanzhi

31:14.900 --> 31:15.960
having an argument

31:16.180 --> 31:16.860
with Gong Zishang

31:16.860 --> 31:18.120
before the explosion.

31:19.380 --> 31:20.310
Gong Yuanzhi...

31:21.560 --> 31:22.760
It was about Miss Yun.

31:23.520 --> 31:24.180
Stop there!

31:24.340 --> 31:25.620
Can't you hear me?

31:26.000 --> 31:26.540
Shut up!

31:26.690 --> 31:28.090
This is my house. Get out.

31:28.500 --> 31:29.760
You cover up for Wufeng

31:30.240 --> 31:31.370
like Gong Ziyu does.

31:31.670 --> 31:33.580
He doesn't deserve to be the Sword Wielder of the Gong family.

31:33.580 --> 31:34.650
And you don't deserve to be

31:34.650 --> 31:35.740
the head of Shang Lineage either.

31:35.740 --> 31:36.750
Whether a person is good or bad

31:36.750 --> 31:38.100
shouldn't be judged by their identity.

31:38.100 --> 31:39.230
You need to feel it by heart.

31:39.230 --> 31:40.560
Do you understand that?

31:40.560 --> 31:42.290
Miss Yun has never hurt anyone.

31:43.750 --> 31:44.840
You don't have a heart.

31:44.840 --> 31:46.710
Of course you wouldn't understand.

31:46.710 --> 31:47.490
Ridiculous.

31:48.060 --> 31:50.390
You're both blinded by that spy from Wufeng.

31:50.390 --> 31:51.790
If she were a good person,

31:51.880 --> 31:53.770
why would she secretly draw the map

31:53.770 --> 31:55.700
and lead Wufeng to break into the Gong Residence?

31:55.700 --> 31:58.580
I left the Gong Residence and went down the hill with Miss Yun once.

31:58.580 --> 31:59.970
If she had that intention,

31:59.970 --> 32:02.050
the map would have been in Wufeng's hands long ago.

32:02.050 --> 32:03.650
How could she let you find it?

32:03.770 --> 32:05.560
She has long defected to us.

32:05.810 --> 32:07.940
She's always been on Gong Ziyu's side.

32:08.270 --> 32:09.970
You drove her away.

32:10.140 --> 32:10.960
Idiot.

32:12.850 --> 32:15.050
No wonder your father hates you so much.

32:33.330 --> 32:34.170
This fragment

32:34.470 --> 32:36.290
was found in the ruins of the warehouse.

32:36.290 --> 32:37.740
This is from the golden silk gloves

32:37.740 --> 32:39.670
for Gong Yuanzhi's exclusive use.

32:39.700 --> 32:41.860
Are you concluding that it was Brother Yuanzhi who did it

32:41.860 --> 32:43.650
just for a fragment of a glove?

32:44.660 --> 32:47.410
It could have accidentally dropped there when they had that argument.

32:47.410 --> 32:48.230
Or maybe

32:48.380 --> 32:49.300
he was framed.

32:49.610 --> 32:51.940
Aren't you being too rash, Sword Wielder?

32:54.380 --> 32:56.650
Young Master Shangjue, you've always been fair and strict.

32:56.650 --> 32:58.460
You've never had selfish intentions.

32:58.460 --> 33:00.060
Why are you trying to cover up

33:01.020 --> 33:02.430
when it comes to your brother?

33:02.430 --> 33:04.090
Verbal aguments are useless.

33:04.890 --> 33:06.320
When Gong Zishang wakes up,

33:06.320 --> 33:07.620
the truth will be revealed.

33:07.620 --> 33:08.100
Fine.

33:09.090 --> 33:10.440
When Zishang wakes up,

33:11.300 --> 33:14.360
she will definitely accuse Gong Yuanzhi of what he did.

33:15.250 --> 33:18.320
What if Zishang couldn't wake up?

33:33.320 --> 33:37.120
[Feng]

33:40.420 --> 33:41.760
When will the battle start?

33:41.760 --> 33:42.540
In five days.

33:44.770 --> 33:46.570
Why do we have to wait for five days?

33:46.570 --> 33:48.840
The information was sent by Shangguan Qian,

33:48.840 --> 33:51.240
a Wufeng spy of level Mei in the Gong family.

33:54.180 --> 33:54.910
Hanya Si.

33:55.310 --> 33:57.240
We met your subordinate on the way.

33:58.530 --> 34:00.100
Do you want to talk to her?

34:04.010 --> 34:05.410
Why did you run into them?

34:05.920 --> 34:06.780
You should ask

34:07.020 --> 34:08.820
why she left the Gong Residence.

34:15.060 --> 34:17.250
I had lost my gloves before the explosion.

34:17.250 --> 34:19.650
I sent someone to look for it for a long time.

34:20.080 --> 34:22.280
I didn't expect them to frame me with it.

34:22.370 --> 34:23.969
Gong Ziyu is so scheming.

34:24.940 --> 34:25.780
So vicious.

34:30.590 --> 34:33.050
It must be because you two young masters forced Yun Weishan to leave

34:33.050 --> 34:34.580
that he wouldn't let you go.

34:36.429 --> 34:38.280
They set you up and wronged you like that, Brother Yuanzhi.

34:38.280 --> 34:40.540
Young Master won't sit by and do nothing.

34:41.219 --> 34:43.080
Brother Yuanzhi, don't be angry.

34:43.760 --> 34:45.610
They have no solid evidence.

34:46.469 --> 34:48.340
They can't do anything to Yuanzhi.

34:48.340 --> 34:50.739
The date of Gong Ziyu's accession ceremony

34:50.820 --> 34:52.040
has been set.

34:54.310 --> 34:55.510
It's already settled

34:57.210 --> 34:59.010
that he'll be the Sword Wielder.

34:59.620 --> 35:01.020
At this critical moment,

35:01.220 --> 35:02.420
it's no good for us

35:03.580 --> 35:04.980
to confront him head-on.

35:06.240 --> 35:07.440
Accession ceremony?

35:09.310 --> 35:09.820
Yes.

35:12.670 --> 35:13.740
In five days.

35:16.450 --> 35:17.340
In five days?

35:17.840 --> 35:19.370
Why did they choose this...

35:24.020 --> 35:25.750
They must have chosen that date

35:25.780 --> 35:26.640
on purpose.

35:27.210 --> 35:27.740
Brother.

35:28.030 --> 35:29.190
This is too much.

35:30.800 --> 35:32.170
Tell Gong Ziyu that

35:32.460 --> 35:33.680
there will be a celestial phenomenon of five stars coming together

35:33.680 --> 35:35.510
ten days from now.

35:36.290 --> 35:38.490
Let him set the date of the accession ceremony

35:38.490 --> 35:39.400
to that day.

35:41.580 --> 35:42.210
Why?

35:43.560 --> 35:45.450
Taking advantage of their internal conflict,

35:45.450 --> 35:46.540
gather the elite,

35:47.700 --> 35:49.940
break into the Gong Residence

35:50.780 --> 35:52.710
when Gong Shangjue's the weakest,

35:52.740 --> 35:53.800
and catch them all.

35:54.650 --> 35:56.310
Don't worry about the reason.

35:56.370 --> 35:57.470
Just do it.

36:04.840 --> 36:06.700
It'll be no use telling Gong Ziyu.

36:07.070 --> 36:08.270
It's too deliberate,

36:08.960 --> 36:10.290
so it'll be suspicious.

36:12.630 --> 36:13.890
Let the Elder tell him.

36:14.590 --> 36:15.650
It's more natural,

36:15.950 --> 36:17.550
and no one will be against it.

36:18.710 --> 36:19.950
I'll find a way

36:20.300 --> 36:21.560
to persuade Elder Yue.

36:21.800 --> 36:22.660
One more thing.

36:23.620 --> 36:25.150
Since Yun Weishan has left,

36:25.770 --> 36:27.430
you must select a new bride

36:28.030 --> 36:29.630
at your accession ceremony.

36:29.720 --> 36:31.520
Let's make it five days from now.

36:32.380 --> 36:33.440
Five days from now,

36:33.520 --> 36:34.740
five stars will come together,

36:34.740 --> 36:36.100
and the sun and the moon will collide.

36:36.100 --> 36:37.450
It's an auspicious omen.

36:37.450 --> 36:39.850
After Gong Ziyu becomes the Sword Wielder,

36:39.910 --> 36:41.840
we'll have to answer to him, right?

36:42.990 --> 36:44.950
We have to bear the consequences of losing the bet.

36:44.950 --> 36:46.810
We made an agreement with him that

36:47.720 --> 36:49.020
if he could make it through the Trial of the Three Realms

36:49.020 --> 36:50.560
in three months,

36:51.210 --> 36:53.470
we'd recognize him as the Sword Wielder.

36:53.920 --> 36:54.920
I won't accept it.

36:57.570 --> 36:58.460
Me neither.

37:07.490 --> 37:08.370
My identity

37:10.660 --> 37:11.460
was revealed.

37:12.350 --> 37:13.150
I had no choice

37:13.710 --> 37:15.430
but to escape from the Gong Residence.

37:15.430 --> 37:16.560
That's impressive.

37:17.850 --> 37:18.980
Wufeng couldn't even get close to the Gong Residence

37:18.980 --> 37:21.460
after fighting against them for more than ten years,

37:21.460 --> 37:23.660
while you could enter and leave freely?

37:24.010 --> 37:25.160
I'm truly stupid.

37:26.530 --> 37:28.100
My identity has been revealed.

37:28.100 --> 37:29.830
If I continue with the mission,

37:30.460 --> 37:32.390
I'm afraid I'll only hold you back.

37:33.020 --> 37:35.670
I just want the antidote to the Fortnight Flies.

37:35.670 --> 37:36.730
The perpetual one.

37:40.620 --> 37:41.820
You promised me.

37:42.850 --> 37:44.710
As long as I complete the mission,

37:44.800 --> 37:45.860
you'll set me free.

37:51.380 --> 37:52.910
Do you really want to leave?

37:54.810 --> 37:56.340
Whether she wants it or not,

37:56.570 --> 37:57.500
she can't leave.

37:59.810 --> 38:01.740
Come with us to the Gong Residence.

38:02.500 --> 38:04.030
Only by redeeming yourself

38:04.280 --> 38:06.410
can you really complete your mission.

38:07.350 --> 38:08.190
By then,

38:08.900 --> 38:10.080
we'll set you free.

38:13.300 --> 38:14.230
What's my guilt?

38:15.480 --> 38:16.610
Everyone is guilty.

38:18.880 --> 38:19.930
If I don't agree,

38:21.740 --> 38:23.360
you won't give me

38:24.720 --> 38:26.980
the antidote to Fortnight Flies, right?

38:30.460 --> 38:31.060
Of course.

38:36.300 --> 38:37.390
If that's all,

38:38.320 --> 38:39.310
I'll get going.

38:40.340 --> 38:41.740
Aren't you staying here?

38:44.450 --> 38:45.900
There are many people watching here.

38:45.900 --> 38:47.210
Many of them know me.

38:47.540 --> 38:49.740
It's inappropriate for me to stay here.

38:49.770 --> 38:51.370
If the Gong family finds out,

38:52.060 --> 38:54.010
it'll ruin your plan.

38:55.460 --> 38:57.600
I'll find a place to stay nearby.

39:07.400 --> 39:08.730
Do you really trust her?

39:09.880 --> 39:11.180
All these years,

39:11.980 --> 39:15.040
only Yun Que managed to escape from the Gong Residence.

39:18.090 --> 39:19.090
Could Yun Weishan

39:19.770 --> 39:21.260
be the next Yun Que?

39:23.430 --> 39:24.960
She's smarter than Yun Que.

39:26.410 --> 39:27.810
She knows what she wants.

39:30.380 --> 39:31.780
She won't be that stupid.

39:32.400 --> 39:33.590
She is indeed smart.

39:34.920 --> 39:36.850
And she knows what she wants.

39:39.650 --> 39:41.370
But I wonder

39:42.230 --> 39:44.030
if what she wants is what we want.

39:44.830 --> 39:45.630
Anyway,

39:46.260 --> 39:47.610
keep an eye on her.

39:50.550 --> 39:51.240
I will.

39:52.110 --> 39:53.510
If something goes wrong,

39:54.120 --> 39:54.920
I can help.

39:55.610 --> 39:56.870
I don't need your help.

39:57.290 --> 39:58.180
I mean,

39:58.970 --> 40:00.550
if you can't do it,

40:02.060 --> 40:02.930
I can help.

40:32.590 --> 40:33.070
Miss.

40:33.640 --> 40:34.500
I remember you.

40:35.220 --> 40:36.920
Where is that handsome young master?

40:36.920 --> 40:38.250
Didn't he come with you?

40:40.580 --> 40:41.540
We broke up.

40:41.920 --> 40:42.930
I wronged him.

40:45.550 --> 40:46.610
Stop joking, Miss.

40:47.150 --> 40:48.120
You are still wearing the love braid

40:48.120 --> 40:49.800
I knitted, aren't you?

40:50.240 --> 40:52.320
I can see that you still haven't let it go.

40:52.320 --> 40:53.940
There must be a misunderstanding between you two.

40:53.940 --> 40:54.870
Go make up for it.

40:54.990 --> 40:55.680
I think

40:55.810 --> 40:57.070
he likes you very much.

41:00.160 --> 41:02.610
Will you send a letter into the Gong Residence for me?

41:02.610 --> 41:03.870
I want to make up for it.

41:04.840 --> 41:05.970
I do want to help you,

41:07.070 --> 41:09.090
but what we sell are not good enough

41:09.510 --> 41:11.440
to be sent into the Gong Residence.

41:17.870 --> 41:19.490
Help me send this letter and the braid

41:19.490 --> 41:20.490
in there.

41:20.790 --> 41:23.850
He will forgive me when he sees the letter and the braid.

41:24.150 --> 41:25.910
You were the one who matchmade us.

41:25.910 --> 41:27.440
You should be responsible.

41:28.460 --> 41:29.880
After you send them in,

41:30.090 --> 41:31.650
I'll buy all your braids.

41:34.020 --> 41:34.420
Yes.

41:34.660 --> 41:35.860
I'll go send them now.

42:10.370 --> 42:11.830
Have you made up your mind?

42:12.070 --> 42:12.750
Yes.

42:18.670 --> 42:19.430
Then leave.

42:25.200 --> 42:26.730
You're willing to let me go?

42:27.750 --> 42:28.710
I let you go

42:30.040 --> 42:31.150
because

42:31.680 --> 42:33.010
you still have a choice.

42:34.580 --> 42:35.710
But I have no choice.

42:38.650 --> 42:39.580
What I can choose

42:41.280 --> 42:42.740
is not to stand in your way.

42:44.090 --> 42:45.350
You also have a choice.

42:48.300 --> 42:49.430
The Fortnight Flies

42:50.060 --> 42:51.280
is not poison at all.

42:53.190 --> 42:55.320
Now that your life is no longer at risk,

42:55.730 --> 42:58.340
you don't have to be threatened by Wufeng anymore.

42:58.340 --> 42:59.370
You can leave too.

43:00.790 --> 43:02.390
Hanya only belong to winter.

43:04.870 --> 43:06.030
They know

43:06.130 --> 43:07.730
there are hunters

43:08.210 --> 43:09.810
and traps in the dark forest,

43:10.230 --> 43:12.900
but they can never fly to the light.

43:14.910 --> 43:17.250
They've been eating dirty mice

43:19.010 --> 43:21.070
and rotten meat since they were born.

43:22.140 --> 43:23.490
Even their screams

43:25.670 --> 43:27.900
are fearful and ferocious.

43:31.390 --> 43:33.070
They can only

43:34.330 --> 43:35.190
live in the dark

43:37.400 --> 43:38.730
and beneath the sunset.

43:58.300 --> 44:00.960
You look out of the window every time you pass by.

44:01.370 --> 44:02.700
What are you looking at?

44:04.830 --> 44:05.420
The sun.

44:06.330 --> 44:07.270
There's no sun.

44:15.510 --> 44:16.620
It's about to set.

44:16.790 --> 44:17.920
What's there to see?

44:18.550 --> 44:20.630
It's exactly because it's about to set

44:20.630 --> 44:22.690
that I want to take another look at it.

44:49.770 --> 44:50.990
You came in first

44:51.220 --> 44:52.320
in this test.

44:56.140 --> 44:57.470
What reward do you want?

45:10.700 --> 45:12.430
Taking me to watch the sunrise.

45:14.360 --> 45:16.120
This is the reward you want?

45:21.020 --> 45:22.620
You always watch the sunset.

45:24.060 --> 45:25.700
But the world after sunset

45:26.370 --> 45:27.230
is black

45:28.500 --> 45:29.530
and cold.

45:31.020 --> 45:33.280
So I want to take you to watch the sunrise.

45:35.620 --> 45:37.090
Everything after sunrise

45:38.850 --> 45:39.820
is warm

45:41.630 --> 45:42.700
and hopeful.

45:44.190 --> 45:44.900
But

45:46.650 --> 45:47.620
after sunrise,

45:48.660 --> 45:49.660
it will be sunset.

45:52.110 --> 45:53.840
No matter how long the night is,

45:54.900 --> 45:56.350
there will be sunrise.

46:03.350 --> 46:05.750
No wall in this world

46:06.960 --> 46:08.940
can stop the sun from rising.

46:13.540 --> 46:15.400
As long as you are willing to wait,

46:15.750 --> 46:16.780
it will come.

46:22.300 --> 46:23.370
Maybe you can.

46:25.850 --> 46:27.370
But I can't.

46:31.550 --> 46:33.350
Why do you have to stay in Wufeng?

46:35.370 --> 46:37.170
What's so good about this place?

46:38.310 --> 46:39.440
The world is so vast.

46:40.030 --> 46:40.830
Why are you...

46:41.210 --> 46:42.210
The world is vast,

46:44.700 --> 46:46.230
but there's no place for me.

46:48.960 --> 46:50.360
Chi, Mei, Wang, and Liang

46:51.190 --> 46:52.920
can only walk alone in the dark.

46:53.460 --> 46:54.720
You are not one of them.

46:55.520 --> 46:56.480
You are Hanya.

47:00.080 --> 47:01.610
Hanya is even more pitiful.

47:04.180 --> 47:05.710
They only belong to winter.

47:07.350 --> 47:09.010
They don't deserve the light.

47:11.440 --> 47:12.840
They only deserve to live

47:13.860 --> 47:15.260
in freezing cold nights.

47:19.200 --> 47:19.970
Go.

47:40.160 --> 47:42.560
No matter how long the night is, it will end.

47:48.690 --> 47:50.770
Do you remember what I told you before?

47:50.690 --> 47:56.010
♫The sun rises in the east and sets in the west♫

47:53.840 --> 47:56.410
There is no wall in this world

47:58.040 --> 48:03.510
♫Our parents call us home for dinner♫

47:59.980 --> 48:02.100
that can stop the sun from rising.

48:05.440 --> 48:11.910
♫We grew up together♫

48:06.410 --> 48:07.230
Hanya Si.

48:12.840 --> 48:18.380
♫We never wake up from our sweet dreams♫

48:12.900 --> 48:13.760
Take care.

48:19.180 --> 48:26.030
♫Spring brews life, and Winter brews coldness♫

48:26.620 --> 48:33.550
♫You're always in my thoughts♫

48:30.970 --> 48:32.830
I watched the sunset so many times

48:33.660 --> 48:35.340
with you.

48:34.100 --> 48:41.370
♫Summer is long, and Autumn is brief♫

48:38.930 --> 48:39.710
This time,

48:41.160 --> 48:43.400
I can finally watch the sunrise with you.

48:42.360 --> 48:47.940
♫I hope we can reunite again♫

48:49.670 --> 48:55.570
♫I hope we can reunite again♫

50:09.650 --> 50:10.220
Look.

50:12.130 --> 50:13.430
These are the fireflies

50:13.430 --> 50:15.090
I saw in the forest last night.

50:15.580 --> 50:16.520
I thought

50:17.570 --> 50:18.750
these fireflies

50:19.740 --> 50:20.450
might be the descendants of the fireflies

50:20.450 --> 50:22.470
you set free before.

50:24.320 --> 50:26.580
So I couldn't help but catch them for you.

50:27.300 --> 50:28.700
I've put them in a bottle.

50:29.460 --> 50:30.790
They'll shine at night,

50:31.670 --> 50:32.620
like a light.

50:43.390 --> 50:44.490
In the past,

50:45.700 --> 50:46.860
you always said

50:48.020 --> 50:49.780
everything that came to your mind without thinking.

50:49.780 --> 50:51.610
What should I name it?

50:52.110 --> 50:55.890
How about I put your surname and my first name together,

50:57.300 --> 50:59.990
and call it Little Jin Zi?

51:00.770 --> 51:03.230
Naming is such an important matter. I'll listen to you.

51:03.230 --> 51:04.360
You've really put me

51:05.920 --> 51:06.840
in a dilemma.

51:08.370 --> 51:09.400
As a man,

51:09.420 --> 51:11.100
when faced with a little difficulty...

51:11.100 --> 51:11.610
No.

51:12.680 --> 51:14.140
I mean, a little surprise,

51:14.530 --> 51:15.430
you don't even know

51:15.430 --> 51:16.560
to face it heads-on.

51:19.030 --> 51:19.950
However,

51:21.690 --> 51:23.880
I miss you now

51:25.980 --> 51:28.510
that I haven't heard your nonsense in a while.

51:36.020 --> 51:37.220
As long as you wake up,

51:40.180 --> 51:41.980
I'll listen to whatever you say.

51:42.580 --> 51:43.750
I won't refute.

51:45.220 --> 51:45.960
Okay?

51:59.580 --> 52:00.710
Marry me then.

52:32.810 --> 52:33.610
You're awake.

52:35.190 --> 52:36.340
Didn't you say

52:37.480 --> 52:38.880
as long as I wake up,

52:39.960 --> 52:41.620
you'll agree to whatever I say

52:42.520 --> 52:43.650
and won't refute?

52:53.260 --> 52:55.060
Go get Gong Ziyu for me.

52:55.440 --> 52:56.090
Hurry up.

52:56.530 --> 52:57.390
In such a hurry?

52:58.300 --> 52:58.720
Yes.

53:00.100 --> 53:01.900
Don't let others know I'm awake.

53:02.230 --> 53:02.670
Okay.

53:25.130 --> 53:27.060
You're already the Sword Wielder.

53:27.630 --> 53:28.490
Leave these

53:29.370 --> 53:30.760
to the servants.

53:32.710 --> 53:34.440
Now that you're back, Brother,

53:35.910 --> 53:38.110
actually the position of Sword Wielder

53:38.550 --> 53:39.830
should be yours.

53:42.480 --> 53:44.180
You're being silly.

53:47.310 --> 53:48.090
Now,

53:49.690 --> 53:52.350
I'm not capable to be the Sword Wielder anymore.

53:53.890 --> 53:54.390
I...

53:55.650 --> 53:57.020
I have a favor to ask.

53:58.010 --> 53:58.680
Okay?

53:59.630 --> 54:00.160
Brother.

54:00.680 --> 54:01.220
Go ahead.

54:02.040 --> 54:02.930
As long as

54:03.490 --> 54:04.480
I can do it,

54:05.320 --> 54:06.350
I won't say no.

54:09.100 --> 54:09.880
You can do it.

54:11.030 --> 54:12.880
Only you can do it now.

54:15.620 --> 54:16.330
Activate

54:17.300 --> 54:18.410
the Infinite Heat.

54:21.100 --> 54:22.060
Infinite Heat?

54:23.010 --> 54:25.110
Don't you want to avenge your father?

54:27.460 --> 54:30.720
Ten years ago, Wufeng slaughtered the entire Gong family.

54:31.520 --> 54:33.140
My parents died tragically.

54:34.460 --> 54:36.790
Thankfully, Uncle adopted and raised me.

54:37.570 --> 54:39.570
He treated me like I'm his own child.

54:39.690 --> 54:42.350
I gradually started to call your father Father.

54:42.570 --> 54:43.490
But he

54:44.210 --> 54:45.850
was killed by Wufeng as well.

54:46.960 --> 54:47.720
We must

54:48.580 --> 54:49.840
take revenge for them.

54:51.020 --> 54:51.550
Brother.

54:54.670 --> 54:55.600
Of course we must

54:56.480 --> 54:57.810
take revenge on Wufeng.

54:59.400 --> 55:01.650
But the Infinite Heat is too powerful.

55:02.680 --> 55:04.880
Once it falls into the hands of the evil,

55:05.220 --> 55:06.540
the people will be plunged into

55:06.540 --> 55:07.780
an abyss of misery

55:08.080 --> 55:09.110
and there'll be bloodshed everywhere.

55:09.110 --> 55:11.370
However, as long as Wufeng still exists,

55:12.150 --> 55:14.880
the bloodshed in the martial world will not stop.

55:15.070 --> 55:16.060
In a world like this,

55:16.060 --> 55:17.860
how can the people live in peace?

55:19.110 --> 55:20.300
They're also living

55:20.300 --> 55:23.500
under the dreadful shadow of being controlled by Wufeng.

55:24.340 --> 55:26.800
Destroying Wufeng is not only personal,

55:28.440 --> 55:29.770
but also about justice.

55:30.140 --> 55:31.270
For righteousness,

55:32.240 --> 55:34.110
sacrifice is inevitable.

55:35.500 --> 55:36.030
Brother.

55:36.730 --> 55:37.740
Take a good rest.

55:43.020 --> 55:44.170
After you recover,

55:45.500 --> 55:47.230
we'll give it further thought.

55:51.800 --> 55:52.580
Ziyu.

55:54.890 --> 55:55.890
You've grown up.

56:07.890 --> 56:09.020
Lord Sword Wielder.

56:09.300 --> 56:10.830
Eldest Young Miss is awake.

56:12.180 --> 56:12.980
Take me there.

56:32.600 --> 56:34.330
After the accession ceremony,

56:34.830 --> 56:37.080
you will be the head of the Gong family.

56:38.270 --> 56:40.140
You must shoulder the responsibility

56:40.140 --> 56:41.300
of protecting

56:41.890 --> 56:43.760
the Gong family.

56:46.130 --> 56:47.930
I'll follow my father's example

56:48.290 --> 56:49.820
and be a good Sword Wielder.

57:04.770 --> 57:06.900
Congratulations, Young Master Ziyu.

57:07.580 --> 57:08.580
Brother Yuanzhi.

57:08.690 --> 57:09.690
From tomorrow on,

57:09.870 --> 57:12.200
you'll have to call me Lord Sword Wielder.

57:13.860 --> 57:14.700
I'm here

57:14.790 --> 57:16.790
to report something to you, Elders.

57:16.800 --> 57:17.480
I'm sorry

57:18.130 --> 57:19.100
that I've been hiding it from you.
